  "description": "Single 8-channel analog mux/demux connecting one of eight channels (CH0..CH7) to the common line, selected by three address lines A/B/C. Active-HIGH INHIBIT disconnects all channels. A separate VEE negative analog supply lets it pass bipolar signals between VEE and VDD; digital control references VSS/VDD. Digital supply 3V to 18V.",
