  "typical_application": "Routing one of eight analog sensor signals into a single ADC input, or fanning one signal out to eight destinations.",
  "gotchas": [
    "channel pins are not in numeric order: CH0=13, CH1=14, CH2=15, CH3=12, CH4=1, CH5=5, CH6=2, CH7=4; COM=3",
    "VEE (pin 7) is a separate negative analog supply, NOT ground; tie VEE=VSS for single-supply signals, or to a negative rail for bipolar",
    "INHIBIT (pin 6) is active HIGH; tie LOW to enable the mux, do not float",
    "address line C (pin 9) is the MSB and A (pin 11) the LSB",
    "channels are bidirectional analog switches (on-resistance hundreds of ohms), not buffered outputs; signals must stay between VEE and VDD"
